{"slug":"592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu","title":"ಸಮುದ್ರ ತೀರದ ವಿಚಿತ್ರ ಸಂಗತಿಗಳು","titleEn":"Samudra Teerada Vichitra Sangatigalu","level":"2","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":548},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":592856,"authors":["Karunya Baskar"],"illustrators":["Karunya Baskar"],"translators":["Dr Akshata Shanbhag"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2023","originalStory":{"title":"Shapes on the Shore"},"copyrightNotice":"\r\n‘Samudra Teerada Vichitra Sangatigalu’ has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org.","attributionLine":"ಸಮುದ್ರ ತೀರದ ವಿಚಿತ್ರ ಸಂಗತಿಗಳು (Kannada), translated by Dr Akshata Shanbhag, based on original story Shapes on the Shore, written by Karunya Baskar, illustrated by Karunya Baskar, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2023) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"strange things","illustrator":"Karunya Baskar","holder":"Karunya Baskar","year":"2026"},{"page":3,"title":"kids chilling_1","illustrator":"Karunya Baskar","holder":"Karunya Baskar","year":"2026"},{"page":4,"title":"mangroves_2","illustrator":"Karunya Baskar","holder":"Karunya Baskar","year":"2026"},{"page":5,"title":"poop","illustrator":"Karunya Baskar","holder":"Karunya Baskar","year":"2026"},{"page":6,"title":"sandcastle city","illustrator":"Karunya Baskar","holder":"Karunya Baskar","year":"2026"},{"page":7,"title":"monsters","illustrator":"Karunya Baskar","holder":"Karunya Baskar","year":"2026"},{"page":8,"title":"house at night_1","illustrator":"Karunya Baskar","holder":"Karunya Baskar","year":"2026"},{"page":9,"title":"running kids_1","illustrator":"Karunya Baskar","holder":"Karunya Baskar","year":"2026"},{"page":10,"title":"garbage_1","illustrator":"Karunya Baskar","holder":"Karunya Baskar","year":"2026"},{"page":11,"title":"garbage_2","illustrator":"Karunya Baskar","holder":"Karunya Baskar","year":"2026"},{"page":12,"title":"last page_1","illustrator":"Karunya Baskar","holder":"Karunya Baskar","year":"2026"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ಕತ್ತಲಲ್ಲಿ ಹೊರಗೆ ಹೋಗಬೇಡ. ಸಮುದ್ರ ತೀರದಲ್ಲಿ ವಿಚಿತ್ರವಾದ ಸಂಗತಿಗಳಿವೆ,” ಎಂದು ಅಜ್ಜ ಎಚ್ಚರಿಸಿದರು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಹಾಗಾಗಿ ವರುಣ್ ಅಣ್ಣ, ಯಶಿಕಾ, ಹರಿ ಮತ್ತು ನಾನು ಅಜ್ಜನ ಮನೆಯ ಜಗುಲಿಯ ಮೇಲೆ ಕುಳಿತು ಆಟವಾಡಿದೆವು: “ಊಹಿಸಿ ನೋಡಿ, ತೀರದಲ್ಲಿ ಏನಿರಬಹುದು?”"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ಬಹುಶಃ ಅವು ಮ್ಯಾಂಗ್ರೋವ್‌ಗಳಿರಬಹುದು,” ಎಂದೆ ನಾ.","“ಮಾಂತ್ರಿಕ ಮರಗಳ ಬೇರುಗಳು ಆಕಾಶದತ್ತ ಬೆಳೆಯುತ್ತವೆ!”"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ಕಡಲ ತೀರಗಳು ಮೀನಿನ ಕಕ್ಕದಿಂದ ಮಾಡಿದ ಹಾಗಿವೆ, ಅಲ್ಲವೇ?","ತೀರಗಳು ತುಂಬಾ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಮೀನೊಂದು ಮಾಡಿದ ಕಕ್ಕದ ರಾಶಿಯ","ಹಾಗೆ ಕಾಣುತ್ತವೆ,” ಎಂದಳು ಯಶಿಕಾ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ಅವು ನನಗೆ ಮರಳಿನ ಕೋಟೆಗಳಂತೆ ಅನಿಸುತ್ತವೆ,” ಎಂದ ವರುಣ್ ಅಣ್ಣ.","“ಇದು ಚಿಕ್ಕ ಚಿಕ್ಕ ಏಡಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಮರಳಿನ ಕೋಟೆಗಳ ನಗರವಾಗಿದೆ.”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ಬಹುಶಃ ಅವು ಸುಂದರವಾದ ಪೂರ್ಣಚಂದ್ರನನ್ನು ನೋಡಲು","ಬಂದ ಸಮುದ್ರ ರಾಕ್ಷಸರಿರಬೇಕು,” ಎಂದ ಹರಿ."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ನಂತರ ನಾನು ಆಕಳಿಸಿದ ಕೂಡಲೇ ಯಶಿಕಾ, ವರುಣ್ ಅಣ್ಣನಿಗೆ ಮತ್ತು ಹರಿಗೆ ಕೂಡ ಆಕಳಿಕೆ ಬಂದವು. ನಾವು ತೀರದಲ್ಲಿರುವ ವಿಚಿತ್ರ ಸಂಗತಿಗಳಿಗೆ, “ಗುಡ್ ನೈಟ್,” ಹೇಳಿದೆವು."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಆಟದಲ್ಲಿ ಯಾರು ಗೆದ್ದಿರಬಹುದು? ಬೆಳಗಿನವರೆಗೆ ಕಾಯಲು ನಾವು ತಯಾರಿರಲಿಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ನಾವು ಯಾರೂ ಗೆದ್ದಿರಲಿಲ್ಲ.","ವಿಚಿತ್ರವೆಂದರೆ ಕಸದ ರಾಶಿಗಳು ಮಾತ್ರ","ನಗರದಿಂದ ನಮ್ಮನ್ನು ಹಿಂಬಾಲಿಸಿದವು."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592856-samudra-teerada-vichitra-sangatigalu/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ನನಗನಿಸತ್ತೆ, ಮತ್ತೆ ಸಮುದ್ರ ತೀರದ ವಿಚಿತ್ರವಾದ ಸಂಗತಿಗಳು ನಮ್ಮನ್ನು ಹಿಂಬಾಲಿಸುತ್ತವೆ ಅಂತ."]}],"wordCount":125}